Para. 1 let. f — Amended by Annex No II 13 of the Financial Institutions Act of 15 June 2018, in force since 1 Jan. 2020 (AS 2018 5247, 2019 4631; BBl 2015 8901).
Para. 2 — Amended by Annex No 14 of the Financial Market Supervision Act of 22 June 2007, with effect from 1 Jan. 2009 (AS 2008 5207 5205; BBl 2006 2829).
Para. 3 — SR 954.1
